Changes made in Blast Shield (Apache-2.0, section 4(b)):
- Renamed from Blast Radius to Blast Shield.
- Classifier: git checkout/restore with paths, combined push flags (-uf), git branch -D,
  git stash drop/clear, find with its delete action, xargs rm, and the timeout, doas,
  env and time wrappers.
- New commands: kubectl delete, terraform/tofu destroy, docker/podman prune and volume
  removal, destructive SQL, recursive chmod/chown/chgrp.
- Measuring: no dotglob when expanding rm globs; dry runs for kubectl, terraform, find,
  branch deletes and stashes.
- Pane: Held and Undo lines, wrapped command, clearer key hint; the refusal message
  names the matched rule.
- Tests: classifier tests (hooks/classify.test.ts) and a real-process check (test/verify.mjs).

